## Main flows

Shared skills are installed separately from repo-kit. Local skills remain in
`.codex/skills/`; project decisions and evidence stay in their owning documents.

| Intent | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| Explain a mechanism or change | `show-me` |
| Choose the next useful action | `next-slice` |
| Resolve design choices or terminology | `grilling`, `domain-modeling` |
| Improve module interfaces | `codebase-design` |
| Review session friction or architecture | Explicit `retro`, `improve-codebase-architecture` |
| Write agent guidance | `writing-for-agents` |

